              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngai, amina kũthayũũkya Mũthũkũmi wake, ambie kũmũtũma amũathime inyw’ĩ, aimũthyũũa kĩla ũmwe wenyu mũtie mothũku menyu.",
